# Corpus effect baseline — the behavioural fingerprint of every
# in-tree example, one section per program.
#
# Regenerate with: scripts/effects-baseline.sh
#
# A diff here means some function's INFERRED effects changed.
# That is either intended (and the diff is the review artifact)
# or a regression annotations could never catch — a handler that
# quietly starts doing filesystem I/O changes no source you would
# think to look at, but it changes this file.

